        "title": {
          "en": "OpenAI Expands Cyber Defense Program with New Model",
          "zh": "OpenAI推出新模型，拓展网络防御项目"
        },
        "tl_dr": {
          "en": "OpenAI is expanding its Trusted Access for Cyber program, introducing GPT-5.4-Cyber to vetted defenders and enhancing safeguards as AI cybersecurity capabilities advance.",
          "zh": "OpenAI正在拓展其网络信任访问计划，向受审查的防御者推出GPT-5.4-Cyber模型，并在AI网络安全能力提升的同时加强保障措施。"
        },
        "key_takeaways": {
          "en": [
            "OpenAI is expanding its 'Trusted Access for Cyber' program.",
            "The program introduces a new model, GPT-5.4-Cyber.",
            "GPT-5.4-Cyber is provided to vetted defenders and fine-tuned for defensive cybersecurity use cases."
          ],
          "zh": [
            "OpenAI正在拓展其‘网络信任访问’（Trusted Access for Cyber）计划。",
            "该计划引入了新模型GPT-5.4-Cyber。",
            "GPT-5.4-Cyber将提供给受审查的防御者，并针对防御性网络安全用例进行微调。"
          ]
        },
        "impact": {
          "en": "This expansion provides specialized AI models to enhance cybersecurity defenses, indicating a strategic focus on utilizing advanced AI to counter evolving cyber threats. The introduction of fine-tuned models for specific defensive applications highlights a practical application of AI in critical infrastructure protection.",
          "zh": "此次拓展为网络安全防御提供了专业化AI模型，表明AI行业正战略性地专注于利用先进AI对抗不断演变的网络威胁。为特定防御应用引入微调模型，凸显了AI在关键基础设施保护中的实际应用价值。"
        },
        "source": "OpenAI News",
        "link": "https://openai.com/index/scaling-trusted-access-for-cyber-defense"
      },
