        "impact": {
          "en": "The release of Gemma 4 indicates Google DeepMind's focus on advancing open models for complex AI applications like agentic systems. This could influence the development and adoption of AI technologies that require sophisticated reasoning capabilities.",
          "zh": "Gemma 4的发布表明谷歌DeepMind致力于推动用于复杂AI应用（如代理系统）的开源模型。这可能影响需要复杂推理能力的AI技术的发展和采用。"
