      {
        "title": {
          "en": "New Benchmark Addresses AI Agent Detection in Mobile GUIs",
          "zh": "新基准旨在解决移动GUI中AI代理的检测问题"
        },
        "tl_dr": {
          "en": "A new benchmark called \"Turing Test on Screen\" has been introduced to assess the \"humanization capabilities\" of autonomous mobile GUI agents against detection.",
          "zh": "一个名为“屏幕图灵测试”的新基准已被推出，用于评估自主移动GUI代理在面对检测时的“人性化能力”。"
        },
        "key_takeaways": {
          "en": [
            "The \"Turing Test on Screen\" benchmark evaluates autonomous GUI agents' \"Humanization capabilities.\"",
            "It prioritizes anti-detection for agents operating in human-centric digital ecosystems, rather than utility or robustness.",
            "The benchmark models agent-detector interaction as a MinMax optimization problem."
          ],
          "zh": [
            "“屏幕图灵测试”基准评估自主GUI代理的“人性化能力”。",
            "它优先考虑代理在以人为中心的数字生态系统中的反检测能力，而非实用性或鲁棒性。",
            "该基准将代理与检测器之间的交互建模为MinMax优化问题。"
          ]
        },
        "impact": {
          "en": "This benchmark shifts focus from agent utility and robustness to anti-detection, highlighting a critical factor for AI agents' long-term viability and integration into existing digital platforms. Agents' survival in human-centric environments now depends on their ability to avoid adversarial countermeasures.",
          "zh": "该基准将评估重点从代理的实用性和鲁棒性转向反检测，强调了AI代理长期生存和融入现有数字平台的关键因素。代理在以人为中心的环境中能否生存，现在取决于它们避免对抗性对策的能力。"
        },
        "source": "arXiv CS.AI",
        "link": "https://arxiv.org/abs/2604.09574"
      }
